      "end": 17526,
      "line": 264,
      "parent_path": "article/section/section/section/p",
      "source_raw": "EmberGen is a real-time volumetric fluid simulation tool that can instantly simulate, render, and export flipbooks, image sequences, and VDB volumes. With EmberGen, you can create anything: from fire and smoke to explosions and magic wisps. EmberGen gives you the creative freedom to iterate on your simulations in milliseconds instead of hours.",
